{"hindi": "माना $f(x)= \begin{cases}(1+a x)^{1 / x}, & x<0 \\ 1+b, & x=0 \\ \frac{(x+4)^{1 / 2}-2}{(x+c)^{1 / 3}-2}, & x>0\end{cases}$

$x=0$ पर संतत है। तो $e^{a} b c$ बराबर है", "english": "Let $f(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}(1+a x)^{1 / x} \quad, x<0 \\ 1+b \quad, x=0 \\ \frac{(x+4)^{1 / 2}-2}{(x+c)^{1 / 3}-2}, x>0\end{array}\right.$

be continuous at $x=0$. Then $e^{a} b c$ is equal to:"}
